  "text": "Intake note (Commercial team, 01/03/2019). Our client Abhishek Saxena is a 53-year-old shopkeeper who lives at Plot 65, Lajpat Nagar, New Delhi 110029 and can be reached on +91 89941 89927 or abhishek.saxena@example.com. The client's PAN DCGPS1569Z.\nThe client consulted us about a cheque bounce matter against Nikhil Subramanian. A cheque for INR 28,50,000/- issued by Nikhil Subramanian bounced: the cheque was returned unpaid for insufficient funds.\nThe cheque was deposited in the client's account no. 186432930048 (IFSC UTIB0433558).\nThe matter was filed as CC/2573/2019 before the Judicial Magistrate First Class Court at New Delhi on 12 September 2019.",
